{title: Daystar - Shine Down On Me}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]Lily of the Valley, [G7]let Your sweet aroma fill my [C]life[G/B]
[Am]Rose of Sharon show me how to grow in beauty in God's [D]sight[D7]
[G]Fairest of ten thousand [G7]make me a reflection of Your [C]light[Cm]
[G]Daystar shine down on me [D]let Your love shine through me in the [G]night

{comment: Chorus}
[C]Lead me Lord, I'll follow.  Anywhere You [D]open up the [G]door
[A7]Let Your word speak to me, show me what I've never seen [D]before[D7]
Lord I [G]want to be Your witness, [G7]You can take what's wrong and make it [C]right[Cm]
