{comment: Verse 2}
Lord I've [G]seen a world that's dying, [G7]wounded by the master of de[C]ceit[G/B]
[Am]Groping in the darkness, haunted by the years of past de[D]feat[D7]
But when I [G]see You standing near me Lord shining with compassion in Your [C]eyes[Cm]
